                                                "sense_id": "34619ca5-08eb-37ea-96d6-ec7d176fb4c5",
                                                "text": "Take thou this vial, being then in bed, / And this distilled liquor drink thou off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12e5b6e8-b9fe-42b0-8390-1872ba131f33",
                                                "sense_id": "34619ca5-08eb-37ea-96d6-ec7d176fb4c5",
                                                "text": "And the second angel poured out his vial upon the sea; and it became as the blood of a dead man: and every living soul died in the sea."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
